   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Anonymous deposit and encrypted tips both need the STRK20 privacy pool. On the test network every private move costs 2 STRK in pool fees and needs a\nprivate balance first, and we have not yet proven that a payment and refund cannot be traced back to you. Until that is proven, the app blocks these paths\ninstead of offering a public payment and calling it anonymous.",
   "originalText": "Anonymous deposit and encrypted tips both need the STRK20 privacy pool. On the test network every private move costs 2 STRK in pool fees and needs a\nprivate balance first, and we have not yet proven that a payment and refund cannot be traced back to you. Until that is proven, the app blocks these paths\ninstead of offering a public payment and calling it anonymous.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
